msgid "Draw separator between title bar and window contents"
msgstr "Trennbalken twischen Titelbalken un Finsterinholt wiesen"

#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:136
msgid ""
"When enabled, this option makes an horizontal separator appear between the "
"window title bar and the window contents."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, gifft dat en kimmrecht Trennbalken twischen den Titelbalken un "
"den Finsterinholt."

#. i18n: file: oxygen/config/oxygenconfig.ui:59
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, showStripes)
#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:139 rc.cpp:50
msgid "Show stripes next to the title"
msgstr "Striepen blang Titel wiesen"

#. i18n: file: oxygen/config/oxygenconfig.ui:56
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, showStripes)
#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:142 rc.cpp:47
msgid ""
"When enabled, this option increases the visibility of the window titlebar by "
"showing stripes"
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, maakt disse Optschoon den Finster-Titelbalken mit Striepen "
"beter sichtbor."

#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:151
msgid "Advanced window decoration configuration options"
msgstr "Verwiedert Instelloptschonen för de Finsterdekoratschoon"

#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:179
msgid "Extra Size grip display:"
msgstr "Gröttgreep wiesen:"

#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:183
msgid ""
"The extra size grip is a small triangle shown in the bottom-right corner of "
"a window \n"
"which allows to resize the window. This option controls in which case this "
"size grip \n"
"is shown."
msgstr ""
"De Gröttgreep is en lütt Dre'eck nerrn rechts binnen elkeen Finster, mit dat "
"sik de \n"
"Finstergrött topassen. Hier kannst Du fastleggen, wannehr de Greep wiest "
"warrt."

#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:196
msgid "Glow active window"
msgstr "Aktiev Finster glönig maken"

#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:199
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, oxygen signature blue glow is used for the "
"active window shadow."
msgstr ""
"Is dit anmaakt, warrt de Finsterschadden mit Oxygen sien Kennmark-Blaag "
"infarvt."

#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:202
msgid "Blend title bar colors with window contents"
msgstr "Titelbalken-Klören na Finsterinholt mischen"

#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:205
msgid ""
"When enabled, window colors are used in place of default title bar colors to "
"draw the decoration"
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt de Finsterklören ansteed de Standard-Titelbalkenklören "
"för de Dekoratschoon bruukt."

#: nitrogen/config/nitrogenconfigurationui.cpp:213
msgid "Configure window specific decoration options, based on window name"
msgstr ""
"Dekoratschoon-Optschonen för enkelte Finstern topassen, na Finsternaams"

